+> square-root bound exists, in ascending order.
+
+The complete ledger is
+`/audit-output/evidence/07-trust-ledger.md`. Trusted/assumed boundaries are:
+
+1. K 7.1.293 and built-in integer/Boolean/remainder, sequencing,
